759	     * Determines whether any existing (non-deleted) owner already carries the given identity key. The
760	     * identity key (the SHA-256 hex over {@code normalizedTelephone + '|' + lowerEmail + '|' +
761	     * soundex(lastName)}) is the single value all duplicate detection is based on, so two owners
762	     * collide only when their whole identity keys are equal.
