918	     * public holiday is rolled forward, one day at a time, until the next non-weekend,
919	     * non-holiday day is reached. This adjusted date is what gets stored as the
920	     * {@code registrationDate} and drives everything derived from it (the fiscal year, the
921	     * membership number's fiscal-year segment, the daily create-limit).
