1004	     * first 12 upper-case hex characters of the SHA-256 digest of {@code normalizedLastName + '|' +
1005	     * postcode}, so it is deterministic across calls and identical for every owner sharing the same
1006	     * normalized last name and postcode — they belong to the same household automatically.
1007	     *
1008	     * @param lastName the last name of the household
1009	     * @param postcode the postcode of the household (may be {@code null})
